**Findings**
- Medium: report construction was duplicated across settings, transcript issue reporting, crash reporting, and plugin error reporting. Each path rebuilt the same `ReportInfo` save-file path and issue-markdown suffix logic, which made drift likely the next time one flow changed. I centralized that into [TermuxReportUtils.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G005_termux/termux-shared/src/main/java/com/termux/shared/termux/TermuxReportUtils.java:11).

I refactored the four callers to use the shared helper: [SettingsActivity.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G005_termux/app/src/main/java/com/termux/app/activities/SettingsActivity.java:74), [TermuxTerminalViewClient.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G005_termux/app/src/main/java/com/termux/app/terminal/TermuxTerminalViewClient.java:775), [TermuxCrashUtils.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G005_termux/termux-shared/src/main/java/com/termux/shared/termux/crash/TermuxCrashUtils.java:323), and [TermuxPluginUtils.java](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G005_termux/termux-shared/src/main/java/com/termux/shared/termux/plugins/TermuxPluginUtils.java:365). That removed the repeated `Environment`/`FileUtils` plumbing from those classes and leaves one owner for default report-file naming and issue suffix behavior.

Verification was static only: repo-wide search now shows those patterns only in the new helper. I could not run a build or tests because this workspace is missing `gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar`, and `gradle` is not installed.

